  "publishedAt": "2026-08-12T06:33:12.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"overviewContentInsertWrapper\"> <div> <div id=\"section__s1\"> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s1/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s1/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s1/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s1/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s1/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s1/main.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s1/main.avif\" alt=\"Photo of the ASUS Oxiis E250G1 intelligent bike booster.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> </picture> </div> <p> <header> <h2><span>ASUS Oxiis E250G1</span> </h2> <h3><span>Ride Easy. Explore More.</span> </h3> </header> </p> <div> <p>Oxiis is a universal, friction-drive motor system that transforms any conventional bicycle into a smart e-bike. Its name fuses the Greek Oxis (agility) and Axis (pivot)—perfectly reflecting how its high-performance drive core delivers ultimate acceleration and instant, nimble responsiveness right to your ride.</p> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s2\"> <p> <header> <h2><span>Focus on essentials</span> </h2> </header> </p> <div data-video-folder=\"s2\"> <div data-index=\"0\"> <div> <h3><span>Adaptive boost technology</span> </h3> <p>Precisely detects inclines, providing seamless assistance for effortless climbs.</p> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s2/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s2/card_1.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s2/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s2/card_1.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s2/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s2/card_1.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s2/card_1.avif\" alt=\"Photo of a girl riding a bike up a slope with the help of the bike booster.\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> </div> <div data-index=\"1\"> <div> <h3><span>Peak power 500W</span> </h3> <p>Instant burst, effortlessly conquering challenging terrains, making every ride easier.</p> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s2/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s2/card_2.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s2/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s2/card_2.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s2/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s2/card_2.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s2/card_2.avif\" alt=\"Image of an electric motor capable of reaching 500 watts of peak power.\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> </div> <div data-index=\"2\"> <h3><span>Wireless cadence sensor</span> </h3> <p>Ditch the wires. Simple to install, smart to ride.</p> </div> <div data-index=\"3\"> <h3><span>Smart brake-detecting taillight</span> </h3> <p>Enhances night visibility and safety, safeguarding your journey.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s3\"> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s3/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s3/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s3/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s3/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s3/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s3/main.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s3/main.avif\" alt=\"A Oxiis bike booster kit on a wooden tabletop, showing its compact design and drive wheel.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> </picture> </div> <div> <header> <p> <h2><span>Design</span> </h2> <h3><span>Simple design. Impressive benefits.</span> </h3> </p> <div> <p>The ASUS Oxiis E250G1 designed with the user in mind: minimum structure, maximum utility. Every detail is meticulously crafted to elevate your daily experience, delivering seamless interaction and a functional masterpiece of premium quality and beauty.</p> </div> </header> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s4\"> <div> <header> <h2><span>Battery</span> </h2> <h3><span>Removable modular battery</span> </h3> <p>Easy to charge and swap, offering ultimate freedom for your journey.</p> </header> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s4/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s4/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s4/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s4/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s4/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s4/main.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s4/main.avif\" alt=\"A sleek black battery pack with an integrated tail light is mounted on the rear rack of a bicycle.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> </picture> </div> <div> <div data-gaid=\"\" data-index=\"1\"> <p>100W <span>USB-C<sup role=\"img\" aria-label=\"registered\">®</sup> PD</span></p> <p><span>2 hours fast charge</span> </p> </div> <div data-gaid=\"\" data-index=\"3\"> <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVQYV2NgYAAAAAMAAWgmWQ0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" alt=\"Airplane-friendly icon\"> </p> <p><span>Flight-safe for carry on luggage (Requires airline approval priority to flying)</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s5\"> <h2><span>Compatibility</span> </h2> <h3><span>Universal design, perfect fit</span> </h3> <p>ASUS Oxiis E250G1 works with a wide range of bike frame types, including city, road, gravel, and folding bikes, as well as hybrid or hardtail mountain bikes.</p> </div> <div id=\"section__s6\"> <div> <h2><span>Accommodates</span> </h2> <h3><span>Find your fit</span> </h3> <p>To guarantee optimal performance, seamless installation, and maximum safety, please double-check that your bike’s specific tire width, wheel size, and seat post measurements fully meet our criteria before your first setup.</p> </div> <div data-video-folder=\"s6\"> <div data-index=\"0\"> <div> <h3><span>Tire width</span> </h3> <p>Supports tire widths up to 60 mm.</p> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s6/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s6/card_1.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s6/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s6/card_1.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_1.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s6/card_1.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_1.avif\" alt=\"Supports tire widths up to 60 mm.\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> </div> <div data-index=\"1\"> <div> <h3><span>Tire size</span> </h3> <p>Compatible with tire sizes from 16 to 29 inches, plus 700C.</p> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s6/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s6/card_2.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s6/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s6/card_2.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_2.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s6/card_2.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_2.avif\" alt=\"Compatible with tire sizes from 16 to 29 inches, plus 700C.\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> </div> <div data-index=\"2\"> <div> <h3><span>Seat post</span> </h3> <p>Fits 25.4-34.9 mm posts (spacers included).</p> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s6/card_3.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s6/card_3.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s6/card_3.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s6/card_3.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_3.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s6/card_3.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s6/card_3.avif\" alt=\"Fits 25.4-34.9 mm posts (spacers included).\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s7\"> <h2><span>Installation Guide</span> </h2> <h3><span>Easy installation</span> </h3> <p>No complex tools are needed to install ASUS Oxiis E250G1.</p> </div> <div id=\"section__s8\"> <div> <header> <h2><span>App</span> </h2> <h3><span>ASUS Oxiis app</span> </h3> <p>Three modes. One seamless experience.</p> <p>Switch modes effortlessly using the integrated button or dedicated app.</p> <div> <div data-gaid=\"\" data-index=\"1\"> <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVQYV2NgYAAAAAMAAWgmWQ0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" alt=\"The Eco mode icon\"> </p> <p><span>Eco mode: Efficient support for flat terrain and tailwinds.</span> </p> </div> <div data-gaid=\"\" data-index=\"2\"> <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVQYV2NgYAAAAAMAAWgmWQ0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" alt=\"The Normal mode icon\"> </p> <p><span>Normal mode: Smooth, balanced power for everyday adventures.</span> </p> </div> <div data-gaid=\"\" data-index=\"3\"> <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVQYV2NgYAAAAAMAAWgmWQ0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" alt=\"The Sport mode icon\"> </p> <p><span>Sport mode: Instant boost for steep climbs and high-speed performance.</span> </p> </div> </div> </header> </div> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s8/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s8/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s8/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s8/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s8/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s8/main.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s8/main.avif\" alt=\"A hand holding a smartphone showing a cycling app interface with speed and battery status.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> </picture> </div> </div> <div id=\"section__s9\"> <div> <picture> <source media=\"(max-width: 730.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/1x/s9/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/small/2x/s9/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(max-width: 1279.5px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/1x/s9/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/medium/2x/s9/main.avif 2x\"> <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s9/main.avif, https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/2x/s9/main.avif 2x\"><img src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/202607/d8499f48-ddce-4b98-88f7-9316afd69a4d/v1/features/images/large/1x/s9/main.avif\" alt=\"A person in a suit riding a bicycle equipped with an Oxiis bike booster.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> </picture> </div> <div> <p> <h2><span>Spec</span> </h2> <h3><span>Product Specifications</span> </h3> </p> <div> <div> <p><span>Motor Power</span> </p> <p>250W (Rated) / 500W (Peak)</p> </div> <div> <p><span>Range</span> </p> <p>50 km (31 miles) in eco mode</p> </div> <div> <p><span>Weight</span> </p> <p>3.7 kg (including battery)</p> </div> <div> <p><span>Dimensions</span> </p> <p>400 x 84 x 128 mm (L x W x H)</p> </div> <div> <p><span>Max Speed</span> </p> <p>32 km/h (Limited to 25 km/h in specific regions)</p> </div> <div> <p><span>Charging Time</span> </p> <p>2 hours (100W PD Charger required)</p> </div> <div> <p><span>App Compatibility</span> </p> <p>Android &amp; iOS</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"subscribeEDM\"> <p>Get local ASUS Zenbook 14 availability alerts - and more from ASUS/ROG</p> </div> </div></div>",
